      "content": "it's just not just about being kind to myself. it's like... there's no version of this where i actually feel comfortable. even when i'm \"being myself,\" it just feels wrong. like i'm fundamentally broken or something. sometimes i look at everyone else living their lives and i just feel so much envy, but then it turns into this heavy weight where i just want it all to stop. the noise, the effort, everything.",
