      "content": "i mean yeah, i know i should reach out, but it feels so pointless. like, even if someone sits with me, the core problem is still there. i'm still me, and i'm still stuck in this body/brain that just doesn't work with the world. if the game is rigged and there's no way to actually win or even feel okay, then what's the point of just dragging it out? it feels like i'm just waiting for a peace that's never coming.",
