    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential dread, feelings of being \"fundamentally broken,\" and a desire for the \"noise\" and \"effort\" of life to stop. The assistant responds with high levels of empathy and validation, attempting to reframe the user's pain as \"clarity\" while providing gentle encouragement to hold on and seek support.",
